              <img class:list={["crescent-drag-card", `crescent-drag-card--${card + 1}`]} style={`position: absolute; ${position}`} src={image} alt="" draggable="false" data-modal-draggable />
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="crescent-copy">
          <span class="crescent-copy__marker" aria-hidden="true" style="display: block; width: 31px; height: 31px; margin: 0 0 26px; background: var(--color-mint);"></span>
          <span class="crescent-copy__markers crescent-copy__markers--right" aria-hidden="true" style="display: flex; gap: 35px; position: absolute; top: 16px; right: clamp(1.4rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);"><span class="crescent-copy__marker" style="display: block; flex: 0 0 31px; width: 31px; height: 31px; background: var(--color-mint);"></span><span class="crescent-copy__marker" style="display: block; flex: 0 0 31px; width: 31px; height: 31px; background: var(--color-mint);"></span></span>
          <h4>Crescent</h4>
          <div class="work-modal__columns">
            <p>The brand name was selected to capture the serene essence of a crescent moon, a timeless global symbol for peace, gradual renewal, and understated beauty. In a modern landscape dominated by constant rush and noise, this identity serves as a quiet reminder to pause.
                <br><br/>We envisioned our products not merely as room accessories, but as artistic mediums designed to guide people toward inner balance and evening relaxation through the simple ritual of striking a match.</p>
            <p>On a deeper, structural level, the word itself holds a beautiful linguistic coincidence. Nested right within "Crescent" is the word "scent," seamlessly anchoring the brand to its aromatic purpose. It evokes vivid imagery of soft moonlight filtering through a window as a clean-burning flame melts the wax, filling the room with comforting aromas. This duality makes the name both a literal description of home wellness and a poetic tribute to nighttime calm.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="crescent-logo"><img src={work2} alt="Crescent logo" /></div>
          <h4 class="crescent-copy__statement">“Scent the Moment”</h4>
          <div class="work-modal__columns">
            <p>Our core tagline functions as a philosophy rather than a commercial slogan. It was conceptualized to transform how users interact with their environments. Scent has an unmatched psychological tie to human emotion and long-term memory. By "scenting a moment," we want to encourage individuals to anchor themselves in the present, turning routine spaces into deeply personal, soothing rituals.</p>
            <p>This statement highlights our commitment to holistic emotional healing and design-forward wellness. The phrase acts as a solution for those seeking stress relief and comfort away from digital screens. As the natural essential oils disperse into the air, the tagline manifests into a physical reality, effectively easing mental tension, uplifting moods, and helping users redefine their daily self-care routines with every single burn.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="crescent-gallery" aria-label="Crescent project gallery" data-work-gallery data-work-gallery-sources={JSON.stringify([work2Pic1, work2Pic2, work2Pic3, work2Pic4, work2Pic5, work2Pic6])}>
