            <p>“Dog Out” is a fast-paced web-based 2D pixel platformer inspired by classic endless runner mechanics. The game places players in a continuous escape from a pursuing dog while dodging obstacles set against vibrant, everyday Vietnamese streetscapes.<br /><br />The name reflects the core gameplay concept of escaping from a pursuing dog, represents the sound of tension and challenge, while “Out” suggests movement, urgency, and the act of getting away.</p>
