          </div>
          <div class="work-modal__columns dogout-copy__intro">
            <p>“Dog Out” is a fast-paced web-based 2D pixel platformer inspired by classic endless runner mechanics. The game places players in a continuous escape from a pursuing dog while dodging obstacles set against vibrant, everyday Vietnamese streetscapes.<br /><br />The name “Dog Out” reflects the core gameplay concept of escaping from a pursuing dog. “Dog” represents the main source of tension and challenge, while “Out” suggests movement, urgency, and the act of getting away. Together, the name conveys a fast-paced, action-driven experience that is simple, memorable, and directly tied to the game’s mechanics.</p>
            <p>Popular casual games often feature generic or abstract settings. Dog Out was envisioned to bridge the gap between lightweight entertainment and local culture. By translating everyday Vietnamese street life as busy alleys, street vendors, and local landmarks into a charming pixel art aesthetic, the game creates an environment that feels immediately relatable, nostalgic, and visually distinct.</p>
